<http://data.silknow.org/object/f888d18d-80bc-3357-9f0b-188655f1827e>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "One of a set of seven. Red, orange, brown and shades of yellow crewels worked with a variety of stitches, including stem, seed, buttonhole, lattice work,  French knots, bullion, etc., on a linen-and-cotton weft twill ground fabric. The design shows a central tree island with bizarre flowers and exotic fruits, Condition: Good. See matching bed curtains (63.1023-.1026) and matching valance (63.1027)."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/7708e7fc-9605-3605-9f17-93db989beea6> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "One of a set of seven. Red, orange, brown and shades of yellow crewels worked with a variety of stitches, including stem, seed, buttonhole, lattice work,  French knots, bullion, etc., on a linen-and-cotton weft twill ground fabric. The design shows a central tree island with bizarre flowers and exotic fruits, Condition: Good. See matching bed curtains (63.1023-.1026) and matching valance (63.1027)."@en ;
